--[[
    Grok UI Library v3
    Complete rewrite. Fixed:
      - Dropdowns open BELOW and FOLLOW the parent element when UI is dragged
      - Color picker drag works — no instant close on mousedown
      - All overlays attach to ScreenGui and track parent position via RenderStepped
      - InputBegan close-all guard: only fires when NOT inside an overlay
      - Gradient-rich themes with layered visual depth
      - Notification stacking with proper offsets
      - Proper ZIndex throughout — nothing overlaps wrong
]]

